      "side": 1,
      "message": "NIT:\nIssue: No timeout-minutes set on the job. GitHub Actions default is 360 minutes (6 hours).\n\nWhy: A hung npm ci on the shared runner (e.g., registry outage) would consume 6 hours of Actions minutes per matrix leg before failing. Weekly cron + PR volume makes this quantifiable waste.\n\nRecommendation:\n```\njobs:\n    audit:\n        name: npm audit\n        runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n        timeout-minutes: 10\n        permissions:\n            contents: read\n\n```",
